/* The hub's Play motion: "Lift and spin", style 04 of docs/design/mockups/19-disc-spin-styles.html (snatcherLeo, 2026-11-09:
 * "I love option 4, Lift and Spin, it reminds me of the Wii"), step for step:
 *   lift   the whole disc rises 6 px in the first fifth, cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), and stays up
 *   spin   2 turns from 0.15 s over 0.85 s, cubic-bezier(0.5, 0, 0.9, 0.5)
 *   sharp  the label 1 -> 0.35 -> 0, linear, from 0.25 s over 0.65 s
 *   trail  3 copies of the label to 20% then 12%, falling 8 / 16 / 24 degrees behind, from 0.25 s over 0.55 s,
 *          cubic-bezier(0.5, 0, 1, 0.6)
 *   smear  the smeared disc fades in from 0.55 s over 0.35 s, ease-in
 *   black  from 0.6 s over 0.4 s, cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 1, 1)
 * Generated by port/tools/hub_play_keyframes.py (each curve sampled every 25 ms, played linearly; each animation runs
 * 2 s and holds its start and end values itself; the reasons are in the script). Regenerate rather than edit. */

